1d:T4dd,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.outbrick.site/blog/tetris-simple-rules-infinite-variation/#article","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.outbrick.site/blog/tetris-simple-rules-infinite-variation"},"headline":"Tetris proves that simple rules can keep opening up","description":"A look at constraint, rhythm, and the endless variety inside a very small ruleset.","image":["https://www.outbrick.site/blog/tetris-simple-rules-infinite-variation.png"],"datePublished":"2026-09-04","dateModified":"2026-09-04","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Mourad Hamdi","description":"Mourad makes small, thoughtful games for the space between one task and the next. OutBrick is his ongoing experiment in calmer play."},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"OutBrick","url":"https://www.outbrick.site","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.outbrick.site/icon.png"}},"articleSection":"Game craft","keywords":"Tetris, puzzle design, game craft, rules","citation":["https://tetris.com/news/the-history-of-tetris","https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6453078/","https://doi.org/10.1037/a0019440"]}13:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1d"}}]
14:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"OutBrick\",\"item\":\"https://www.outbrick.site\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Journal\",\"item\":\"https://www.outbrick.site/blog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Tetris proves that simple rules can keep opening up\",\"item\":\"https://www.outbrick.site/blog/tetris-simple-rules-infinite-variation\"}]}"}}]
15:["$","p","The rights-holder’s history blends historical record with brand storytelling, so exact sales totals should be treated as company-reported figures. The broader sequence is enough for a design lesson: a compact idea can travel when its rules survive the journey to a new context.",{"children":"The rights-holder’s history blends historical record with brand storytelling, so exact sales totals should be treated as company-reported figures. The broader sequence is enough for a design lesson: a compact idea can travel when its rules survive the journey to a new context."}]
